    {
      "document_id": "967",
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "Senator Shelby announces federal funding of over $3 million for childcare programs in Alabama and connects the announcement to his role as a member of the Senate Appropriations Committee, which matches clarification (1)."
    },
    {
